  },
  "components": [],
  "description": {
   "type": "doc",
   "version": 1,
   "content": [
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 2
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Summary"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "paragraph",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Filter selections are stored server-side against the user's account, so they survive logout, sync across devices, and are waiting exactly as the user left them \u2014 eliminating the daily pain of re-applying the same filters."
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 2
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Context"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "bulletList",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "The user has previously applied one or more filters"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Persistence applies uniformly to every view/tab that has filters, with no exceptions"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "The search query is explicitly NOT covered \u2014 it is session-scoped (see Story 13)"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 2
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Requirements"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "orderedList",
     "attrs": {
      "order": 1
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "When the user navigates away from Work Orders and returns, filter selections and collapsed/expanded state are restored exactly \u2014 ("
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "PRD: Story 10, S10-R1",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "link",
             "attrs": {
              "href": "https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/shopviewapp/pages/572030978/Filters#Story-10:-Filter-Persistence"
             }
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": ")"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Filter selections are stored server-side against the user account; they survive logout, sync across devices, and use last-write-wins for conflicts \u2014 ("
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "PRD: Story 10, S10-R2",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "link",
             "attrs": {
              "href": "https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/shopviewapp/pages/572030978/Filters#Story-10:-Filter-Persistence"
             }
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": ")"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Filter selections are saved per user; one user's filters do not affect another user \u2014 ("
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "PRD: Story 10, S10-R3",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "link",
             "attrs": {
              "href": "https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/shopviewapp/pages/572030978/Filters#Story-10:-Filter-Persistence"
             }
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": ")"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Persistence applies uniformly to every view/tab with filters. Each Parts view and each Report tab keeps its own separate filter set, and each persists independently \u2014 ("
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "PRD: Story 10, S10-R4",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "link",
             "attrs": {
              "href": "https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/shopviewapp/pages/572030978/Filters#Story-10:-Filter-Persistence"
             }
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": ")"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "The search query is not persisted server-side \u2014 ("
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "PRD: Story 10, S10-R5",
           "marks": [
            {
             "type": "link",
             "attrs": {
              "href": "https://shopview.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/shopviewapp/pages/572030978/Filters#Story-10:-Filter-Persistence"
             }
            }
           ]
          },
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": ")"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 2
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Out of Scope"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "bulletList",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Search query persistence (session-scoped only, see Story 13)"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "type": "listItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "content": [
          {
           "type": "text",
           "text": "Parts and Reports filter configuration (separate epic)"
          }
         ]
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "heading",
     "attrs": {
      "level": 2
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "text",
       "text": "Acceptance Criteria"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "type": "taskList",
     "content": [
      {
       "type": "taskItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Given I set filters and navigate to a WO detail page, when I return to the list, then my filters are exactly as I left them"
        }
       ],
       "attrs": {
        "localId": "a2360b4d-3b42-4bc0-b8fb-18dcf5686ff6",
        "state": "TODO"
       }
      },
      {
       "type": "taskItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Given I set filters on Device A, when I log into Device B, then the same filters are applied"
        }
       ],
       "attrs": {
        "localId": "5f969b66-2b92-41cd-9441-abbaf4a5639c",
        "state": "TODO"
       }
      },
      {
       "type": "taskItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Given two devices write different filter state, then the last write wins"
        }
       ],
       "attrs": {
        "localId": "fd0abaa1-56c1-4924-9832-817c70ead67a",
        "state": "TODO"
       }
      },
      {
       "type": "taskItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Given I log out and log back in, then my filters are restored"
        }
       ],
       "attrs": {
        "localId": "57eae5ff-92af-4773-930c-75bb0863374e",
        "state": "TODO"
       }
      },
      {
       "type": "taskItem",
       "content": [
        {
         "type": "text",
         "text": "Given a previously selected filter value no longer exists, then the system silently ignores it"
        }
       ],
       "attrs": {
        "localId": "78eac6f9-efb8-455a-a9b6-f61ce89ddcd2",
        "state": "TODO"
       }
      }
     ],
     "attrs": {
      "localId": "b70b384f-efe6-4e73-8fb0-3171fc9b737b"
     }
    }
   ]
  },
